/**
 * @defgroup MIDILAR_Protocol Protocol
 * @ingroup MIDILAR
 * @brief Shared MIDI concepts and separate native/protocol representations.
 *
 * - Shared: Channel/ChannelMask, NoteNumber, ControllerNumber, ProgramNumber,
 *   SystemStatus, VoiceStatus, TimeCode, scaling and MCC pitch conversion.
 * - @ref MIDILAR_Midi "Midi": native short bytes and caller-buffer SysEx.
 * - @ref MIDILAR_Midi2 "Midi2": native channel-voice messages and high-resolution values.
 * - @ref MIDILAR_Ump "Ump": packets, groups, format statuses, stream/USB adapters
 *   and explicit protocol conversion. UMP carries both MIDI versions.
 *
 * Native headers under Midi/ and Midi2/ do not include UMP. Devices route
 * Ump::Packet. Ump::Encode adds group/type; DecodeMidi1 and DecodeMidi2 check
 * the representation before exposing native bytes or fields. No implicit
 * conversion changes protocol resolution.
 *
 * Storage templates and tag types are implementation details under Detail.
 * See the UMP migration section for renamed namespaces and header paths.
 * The @ref MIDI_Protocol guide retains the historical MIDI 1.0 topics.
 */
/** @namespace MIDILAR::Protocol
 * @ingroup MIDILAR_Protocol
 * @brief Shared concepts and the Midi, Midi2 and Ump components.
 */
